# BUNDLE.manifest — dark-factory experimental federation
#
# dark-factory is an experimental research scaffold. This manifest exists for
# ADR-0003 compliance and to scope what a release tarball would contain: only
# the file-set that defines the federation in the source repo. It deliberately
# excludes operator-edited configs (`colony.toml`) and runtime artifacts
# (`.agentis/`, the warm `solana-harness/target/`, `.solana-harness/`) — the
# bundler uses `cp -pR`, which does NOT honour `.gitignore`, so an unscoped
# `dark-factory/` line would leak those into a release tarball if anyone ran
# the federation locally before bundling.

# ----- Federation-level files -----
dark-factory/VERSION
dark-factory/CHANGELOG.md
dark-factory/BUNDLE.manifest
dark-factory/README.md
dark-factory/install.sh
dark-factory/setup-solana-toolchain.sh

# ----- Shared assets -----
# The offline Solana PoC harness skeleton (Cargo.toml/.lock, .cargo/config.toml,
# src/) and the detection fixtures. The warm `solana-harness/target/` and any
# staged `.solana-harness/` are produced by setup-solana-toolchain.sh and are
# NOT shipped.
dark-factory/solana-harness/Cargo.toml
dark-factory/solana-harness/Cargo.lock
dark-factory/solana-harness/.cargo/config.toml
dark-factory/solana-harness/.gitignore
dark-factory/solana-harness/README.md
dark-factory/solana-harness/src/
dark-factory/fixtures/

# ----- hunt-dashboard component (#1913) -----
# The reusable read-only, loopback-only single-hunt dashboard: the Python server + its loopback launcher
# + usage docs. A RUNTIME operator tool. Its `fixtures/` are test-only (driven by the top-level
# `demo-hunt-dashboard.sh`, which — like every `demo-*.sh` — is contributor-only and stays out of the
# tarball), so they are deliberately NOT listed here.
dark-factory/hunt-dashboard/hunt-dashboard.py
dark-factory/hunt-dashboard/hunt-dashboard.sh
dark-factory/hunt-dashboard/README.md

# ----- auditor colony surface -----
# Explicitly excludes `config/colony.toml` (operator-edited) — only the
# `colony.example.toml` template is shipped.
dark-factory/auditor/README.md
dark-factory/auditor/agents/
dark-factory/auditor/config/colony.example.toml
dark-factory/auditor/scripts/
# The #1794 shared harness-mock library: dependency-free Solidity mocks
# run-invariant-hunt.sh stages into every generated invariant harness. A
# RUNTIME dependency of the deep-hunt path, not contributor-only tooling.
dark-factory/auditor/harness-mocks/
